{"meta":{"id":"compile-time","category":"it/syntax/typescript/compile","title":"컴파일 시점에만 검사되는 제한 · TS","subtitle":"(TYPESCRIPT)","summary":"interface · type, Union · Literal, readonly, private · protected, 제네릭 제한, implements · satisfies","tags":["typescript","f-compile"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>TYPESCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">컴파일 시점에만 검사되는 제한 · TS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> interface · type, Union · Literal, readonly, private · protected, 제네릭 제한, implements · satisfies</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">컴파일 시점에만 검사되는 제한</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">문법</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">컴파일 후</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>interface, type</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">타입 정의 자체가 JS 에서 사라짐</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>Union, Literal</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">허용 값 검사는 컴파일 때만 — 외부 입력(API 응답)은 검사 안 됨</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>readonly</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">재할당 금지는 타입 검사뿐, JS 객체는 바뀔 수 있음</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>private, protected</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">JS 에서는 일반 속성 — obj[&#x27;x&#x27;] 로 접근 가능</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>제네릭 타입 제한</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">&lt;T extends …&gt; 제약은 컴파일 후 사라짐</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>implements, satisfies</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">형태 확인만 하고 코드는 남기지 않음</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">컴파일 전 / 후</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">// TypeScript\r\ninterface User { readonly id: number }\r\nclass A { private secret = 1 }\r\nconst u: User = { id: 1 };\r\n\r\n// ↓ tsc 결과 (JavaScript) — 타입 정보가 모두 지워짐\r\nclass A { constructor() { this.secret = 1; } }\r\nconst u = { id: 1 };</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">satisfies</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">typescript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">type Theme = Record&lt;&quot;bg&quot; | &quot;fg&quot;, string&gt;;\r\n\r\nconst theme = {\r\n  bg: &quot;#fff&quot;,\r\n  fg: &quot;#000&quot;,\r\n} satisfies Theme;     // 형태만 검사하고, 타입은 실제 값(리터럴) 그대로 유지</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> 컴파일 › 실행 시점에도 영향을 주는 문법, 파일 › tsconfig</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/typescript/compile/compile-time","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"typescript","title":"TYPESCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/typescript"},{"id":"compile","title":"컴파일","path":"it/syntax/typescript/compile"}],"hasImage":false}